  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Badily Balanites Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agro-processing (Balanites Oil), Beneficiaries: 35 members, Town/City: Aleg Commune, Brakna Region , Summary: The project funds will be used to provide processing equipment for balanites oil production, and provide a revolving fund and technical assistance. Additionally, training in financial and organizational management and literacy will be provided to help the organization improve its capacity and become sustainable. This Project is a collaborative effort with several other institutions including the United Nations Development Program, The Association for the Development and the Promotion of Human Rights and Tooga, a private company. ,</narrative>
  </description>
